This license covers the source code of the emot3 addon. The repository also
bundles, for runtime convenience:

- Official emote artwork under resources/emotes_official/ is copyrighted by
  ArenaNet. These remain ArenaNet's property and are not licensed under MIT;
  they are redistributed here purely as cosmetic assets for the addon.
- AI-generated emote artwork under resources/emotes_ai/ and 
  resources/me_motes_ai/ is opt-in at runtime and covered by this MIT license 
  alongside the rest of the project.
- UI artwork under resources/ui/ was authored for this project and is covered
  by this MIT license.

Vendored third-party libraries under vendor/ retain their original licenses
(see each submodule's own LICENSE file).
